      "message": "docs(process): MCP issues carry area:mcp and P1\n\nAGENTS.md \"Commands ship with an MCP tool\" now says every MCP issue\n(an `MCP:` title, or work on the MCP server or the camcraft-mcp skill)\ncarries `area:mcp` and is P1. The camcraft-mcp skill's two quotes of\nthat rule match. PROCESS_VERSION 4 -> 5.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
